                            "last_played": 1793431014
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]Fetch me their souls![/b]\n\nZombies is easily the highlight for me. The base game already offers a great experience, but the Zombies Chronicles DLC makes it even better. Workshop integration is another huge W, giving players easy access to awesome custom maps and mods. Another thing that surprises me is how well the game has aged. The graphics and sound design still hold up incredibly well today. Multiplayer was a ton of fun back in its prime, although I can't really speak for its current state. I haven't touched the campaign yet either, so I can't give an opinion on that. \n\nHighly recommend picking it up if you're a fan of Zombies, as well as the Chronicles DLC. You should wait for a sale though, because Activision is greedy...\n\n[h1]9/10[/h1]",
                        "timestamp_created": 1791601585,
